orts of illicit things. But he has volunteered to travel to the Sartin compound because that is where the path leads to finding their missing brother that was stolen from them when he was an infant. By promising to wed one of the Sartin daughters, he will be able to enter their compound to search for clues. Now all he has to do is keep himself under control and not let anyone see what he truly is, a beast. All of these goals go out the window, though, when he first catches her scent. From that moment on, SHE is all he wants.<br><br><img alt="" src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1646764676i/32662949._SY540_.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Keira Sartin is the defective daughter of the family. Told repeatedly that she is worthless. Because of this, the alphas in her family freely discuss things in her presence. Unknowingly giving her much needed information she can use for her own agenda. An agenda that does not include the very sexy alpha she meets. The same alpha she later discovers is supposed to marry her younger sister. All she has to do is stay away from him which proves much more difficult than she imagined.<br><br><b>
  <i>“I’d rather drag you into the darkness with me than take another breath without you.”</i>
</b><br><br>Alexi and Keira together were scorchingly hot. But they also were so much more. They were the missing part of each other they didn’t even know existed. As always with this series, we are kept on the edge of our seat from page one until the very last word. I am continually surprised at the amount of love these Skolov siblings share and never hesitate to show one another in the dark world they exist in. I believe it is this love, this commitment to one another that always pulls them through. <br><br><img alt="" src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1646764676i/32662950.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>This has a perfect epilogue and we are also given just a hint of the next book, Filthy Royal, which will be Damien’s book. <br><br><b>
  <i>“I’ve waited a lifetime to find you.”</i>
</b><br><br>For more about this book and so many others, come and visit me at Carol's Crazy Bookish World.<br><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/CarolsCrazyBookishWorld">https://www.facebook.com/groups/Carol...</a><br><br><img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1502304251i/23548582.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=paranormal-fantasy" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal-fantasy</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">66 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">19 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1