again, Miss Alison has rocked my world and punched me in the feels, aaalllllll the feels…EVERYWHERE. But if getting punched feels that good, then I’d happily take those punches every. day. <br /><br />Alexi is on a mission to find his missing brother. He needs to prove to his other siblings that he’s more than the gorgeous alpha who has all the omegas dropping to their knees. <br /><br />There was never a dull moment in this action-packed story. Not only was it entertaining and full of kindle-gripping goodness, it also had lots and lots of toe-curling yumminess and heartwarming love and adoration and so many moments that put little hearts in my eyes. <br /><br />Alexi is so much more than what everyone believes him to be. His loyalty and determination and dedication…so admirable. His strength and kindness and the need to please and care for his omega…so effing swoony and charming and sweet and left me all smiley and drunk with contentment and happiness. *sigh*<br /><br />Give me that sexy beast!<br />The growls, the fangs, the eyes…I’ll take all of him, just the way he is please and thank you. <br /><br />Broken Heir was yet another masterpiece in this amazingly written series. So many captivating moments had me glued to my Kindle. Some parts so emotionally intense, I wanted to hug someone. Scenes so intoxicating, I couldn’t look away if I tried. <br /><br />I highly recommend this book. If you’ve read and loved the other books in this series, you need this one. If you haven’t read this series, do yourself a favor and start it soon. You won’t regret it. <br /><br />If I ever get so lucky to meet Alison Aimes, I will probably embarrass myself fangirling so hard. :)</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__contain