 Warlords series and features Keira and Alexi and it was an epic love story between two tragically scarred souls that find each other and thrive.<br /><br /><blockquote>
  <i>“I’d rather… drag you into the darkness with me… than take another breath without you.”</i>
</blockquote><br /><br />After the events of the second book, Alexi goes to meet his betrothed and ends up finding his fated mate and falls into bed with her without knowing who she is. Keira (who has plans of her own) also has no idea who Alexi is but they find out shortly after and it sets a string of events in place that sets a new path for Alexi and his family, Keira, and the quest to discover where Alexi's siblings are. Will they all make it out in one piece?<br /><br />Alexi was the broken Alpha with a tragic past and he has carried that past with him for a long time always worried that he will snap one day and have to be put down. His inner turmoil was sad to read but Keira's light brought him back from the brink of loneliness and hopelessness and gave him a new lease on life. Alexi thinks so badly of himself and the beast he can become at times but deep down he is a loyal and devoted Alpha with so much heart, love and devotion to give. He only had to finally see it.<br /><br /><blockquote>
  <i>“Mine… to touch. Mine… to pleasure. They want me… to hurt you? Fuck that. I’ve had enough… pain and violence to last… a lifetime. You belong to me now, and… I care for what’s mine.”</i>
</blockquote><br /><br />Keira also has a heartbreaking past but she has a spine of steel and fights for those she considers "hers." She was the perfect other half to Alexi and I loved that she accepted every little piece of him and the feelings and reactions she had to him. Their mutual respect and adoration for each other created a beautiful relationship between the two that I couldn't help but love. Her tenacity and strength made her and Alexi an unbreakable force.<br /><br /><blockquote>
  <i>“We fit because we are alike, Alexi. Because deep down, I’m as ferocious as you, and I will do anything—risk anything—to keep you with me"</i>
</blockquote><br /><br />Broken Heir was a steamy steamy Omegaverse. I loved Alexi's animalistic tendencies and his domineering, controlling and possessive attitude toward Keira. Their intimate moments were *chefs kiss.* I enjoyed that this was also action packed and kept you on your toes with revelations I never saw coming. It sets the stage for more stories and I can't wait to read what's next in this world and their continuing quest to locate their sister. I only wish that we had gotten more time with Alexi and Keira being bonded. If you like darker Omegaverse stories with strong Alphas and their feisty Omegas, then I definitely suggest picking up this series!<br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">6 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 comment</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.