364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4133258894">April 20, 2022</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted"><img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1650416517i/32833617._SY540_.png" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br><strong>A tragic journey to find love, hope, and acceptance for two damaged souls...</strong><br>*****<br>Rating: 5 stars<br>Steam: 3 flames<br>Genre: Omegaverse / Mafia / Sci-fi Romance/ Fated Mates / Broken Hero &amp; Heroine<br>*****<br>Note to self… do not start a new Alison Aimes book at 8 pm on a work night thinking, “I will only read a few chapters…” Yeah, that did not happen…Once I started reading this book, I became so engrossed by the plot, twists, and turns that I stayed up all night reading! <br><br>This book was AH-MAZING! <br><br>Alexi was so much more than I imagined. His backstory was tragic and what he suffered at 13 yrs old… horrendous. However, getting inside his head was almost worse, the self-loathing/deprecation and fear could almost be felt through the pages. Despite the horrors he endured, he remained a good man... In beast mode, he may unalive a lot of people, but he remained a protector…deeply devoted to his family, and then Keira. He's also sexy and determined to keep his omega satisfied if you know what I mean (wink wink). PLEASE! YES!<br><br>Keira's past is equally heartbreaking, and the fact that she puts that aside...puts all the cruelty she lives with aside, to safeguard those who are unable to protect themselves... I adored her character. Not only is she strong…she is the perfect match for Alexi and his beast.<br><br>Broken Heir was an exciting, steamy, action-packed story full of betrayal, deception, and jaw-dropping twists and turns. The end had me losing my mind! And the character growth, even with the Alpha / Omega dynamic, Alexi and Keira matured romantically throughout the story, and in the end, their relationship was more than just pheromones; it was a true bonding! SWOON!<br><br>If you are looking for a magnificent sci-fi omegaverse mafia, with plenty of steam, unaliving, and a gripping storyline… THIS IS YOUR BOOK! Actually, THIS IS YOUR SERIES! <br><br>My only regret… I read Broken Heir too quickly and now that it is over… I want… no need…more! This book/series gets all my recommendations and is a MUST READ romance in my opinion!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=2022-books" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2022-books</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=anti-hero" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">anti-hero</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=arc" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></s