994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4374541674">April 21, 2022</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Broken Heir is book three in the raw and darkly sexy world of author Alison Aimes Ruthless Warlords. This story takes place on the brutal world ruled by the Sartin's. <br><br>Keria Sartin is the abused and brave daughter of the Alpha’s brother. Because they think that she is nothing and no one they speak freely around her so she has knowledge of everything that goes on in the household. <br><br>She has her own, personal plans and she uses the information that she is privy to to save others from the hateful Alpha. She learns that her sister is to be married to a powerful Alpha. But before she can do anything about that she has other plans in motion that must be fulfilled. Escaping her uncle’s warrior’s, she is saved by a very handsome and strong Alpha. <br><br>Alexi Skolov is a tortured male. Almost broken in spirit and mind but he holds tight the beast that wants to break free. He uses women and drugs and liquor to dull his wild urges. He’s on a mission to the Sartin’s seeking family information. And he is to sign a marriage contract with a Sartin bride. He doesn’t care. He only wants to complete his mission. <br><br>They were never supposed to meet but it was fate. When Alexi and Keria come together each knows that it’s more than a forbidden night. They are soul mates. They complete each other. <br><br>This universe is mean and dark and savage. Danger lurks around every turn. But the love that shines from the family Skolov breaks through as if a million shining suns. <br><br>If you love dark, sexy, strong Alpha’s and smart, brave, beautiful heroines this series is worth reading! It takes you into their world and love and it’s brilliant! <br><br> <img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1642780055i/32473872.png" width="145" height="115" alt="description" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abuse" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">abuse</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abused-hero" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">abused-hero</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abused-heroine" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">abused-heroine</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">3 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.0