40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4369139076">March 9, 2022</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">For anyone who hasn't yet read the"Ruthless Warlords" series by author, Alison Aimes, my question is, "What are you waiting for?" This series is an omegaverse romance about the Skolov crime family, whose members have grown from poverty to one of the richest and most powerful families in the brotherhood.<br /><br />"Broken Heir" is the newest addition to this fabulous saga! And this is Alexi's story. Alexi is the broken brother. Kidnapped as a child, he was tortured, abused, beaten, and injected with drugs to create a berserker beast within him. Although he was eventually found and rescued by his brothers, the damage had been done. He is the bad boy of the Skolov family: massive, good looking, out of control, and completely alpha! He is dangerous and feels there is no hope for his future. And, what woman doesn't love the bad boy, especially when he will do anything to protect those he loves? Alexi is just yummy!<br /><br />Keira Sartin is the broken Omega heroine in the story. She is beautiful, smart and underestimated, seen as a barren omega without any special gifts normally indicated in omegas. But while being seen as useless, she is able to achieve her own agenda. She works underground to help omegas escape with their newborn babies to safety, off planet. Keira is a bit of a badass, which I love in a heroine. Her main objective is to see her younger sister married to a member of the Skolov crime family where she will be taken away to safety. But a one night stand with a gorgeous alpha male in the pleasure district will change all of Kiera's plans.<br /><br />The main plot in this series has been for the Skolov family to find and recover their twin siblings who were stolen from their crib while infants. Now, when the twins are about fifteen, the family has tracked down the whereabouts of the male twin. An underlying plot has been to determine who is attempting to take down the entire brotherhood, but particularly the Skolov family. In this book, we get some resolution, but there is still a ways to go...thus the saga continues! Each book in the series is a standalone novel, featuring one of the Skolov family members and their mate, and is complete with a happy ending. Although there are no cliffhangers, I do recommend that you read the books in order, as the story does evolve.<br /><br />Love, love, love this series, and "Broken Heir" is the absolute best one yet! Alison Aimes does a fantastic job of delivering us an action packed storyline that will keep us on the edge of our seat and she gives us wonderfully written sexy bedroom scenes that are sure to melt panties everywhere! Damien's story is up next and I can't wait!!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 comments</span