="baseClass RatingStar--small"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="presentation"><path class="RatingStar__fill" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4363556698">March 12, 2022</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">i absolutely loved this book!<br /><br />after reading 𝗿𝘂𝘁𝗵𝗹𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗸𝗶𝗻𝗴 and 𝘀𝗮𝘃𝗮𝗴𝗲 𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗰𝗲, of course my expectations for 𝗯𝗿𝗼𝗸𝗲𝗻 𝗵𝗲𝗶𝗿 had to be high and alison met every single one of them. from the easily lovable characters to the plot, i thoroughly enjoyed everything!<br /><br />alexi skolov just kept breaking and repairing my heart. his backstory broke my heart more times than i could count, especially the flashback scenes. it felt like my heart was being ripped open as i read about his abusive past and then reading about how much he hated, doubted and undermined himself in the present. he's a person who deserves the entire universe and thankfully, keira is there to give it to him. he's so thoughtful and selfless and considerate, an absolute sweetheart with the perfect amount of possessiveness and dirty talk.<br /><br />keira, my brave baby. she's so fierce and strong and brave. her actions toward the omegas filled me with so much pride, even though i don't know her. even when dealing with alexi's beast, she was so incredibly determined and she's such a powerful individual. i loved seeing her develop her self-confidence and become more reassured and happy with herself. <br /><br />keira and alexi are soulmates, one soul that was split into two halves. their relationship was so pure, so beautiful. <br /><br />the intensity between the two of them in the beginning of the book had me blushing. there's just something so intense, so extreme, so passionate about all the skolovs and it was no different with alexi and his unabashed love and lust for his fated mate. <br /><br />keira and alexi's swoon-worthy relationship aside, i loved the skolov brothers relationship. their bickering and banter had me cackling because of how ridiculous they are. they're both hilarious and so cute together. <br /><br />i wish i'd see more moments of my favourite past couples, dahlia and nikolai and maxheim and tesstala, but getting those brief glimpses were enough and i'm so excited for damien and anya's stories!<br /><br />once again, alison outdid herself and i'm so eager for the rest of this series!!<br /><br />𝘁𝗿𝗶𝗴𝗴𝗲𝗿 𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗻𝗶𝗻𝗴𝘀: 𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗼𝗳 𝗽𝗵𝘆𝘀𝗶𝗰𝗮𝗹 𝗮𝗯𝘂𝘀𝗲, 𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗲, 𝘀𝗲𝘅𝘂𝗮𝗹 𝗮𝘀𝘀𝗮𝘂𝗹𝘁, 𝗱𝗿𝘂𝗴 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗮𝗹𝗰𝗼𝗵𝗼𝗹 𝘂𝘀𝗲, 𝗰𝗵𝗶𝗹𝗱 𝗮𝗯𝘂𝘀𝗲/𝗮𝘀𝘀𝗮𝘂𝗹𝘁, 𝗺𝘂𝗿𝗱𝗲𝗿, 𝘁𝗼𝗿𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲, 𝗴𝗼𝗿𝗲.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inli