www.goodreads.com/review/show/4628647040">March 25, 2022</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️/🔥🔥🔥🔥<br />After a few heavy reads I needed to get back to the meat and potatoes of it all, and what’s better than blending dark mafia and aliens with an Omegaverse??<br /><br />I found a very happy place with Alexi and Keira. Oh these two are a piece of work, but I’ll get to that. Alexi is a slave to the beast who lives inside him. There’s a story there, but you’ll have to read to know because it’s better that way. Let’s just say Alexi Skolov and Bruce Banner can both Hulk Smash it out. Kiera, better known as a defective Omega is at the mercy of her cruel warlord Alphahole uncle and her careless father. She’s berated on the regular, but her heart remains pure.<br />All it takes is for these two strangers in the night to “exchange glances” and feel/sense one another’s presence to draw them together, but only for a night. That one night is as hot as several suns and hell’s depth. But fate. Fate is a cruel and unusual bish because the reality of who these two really are will set off some interplanetary disputes that will leave you saying, what the hell did I read and can I have some more please?!<br />⚠️Don’t miss the artwork download at the end of the book!😱 Totally NSFW!<br />⭐️This is book 3 in the series and there is a novella companion as well to be read first. Go get into this series, but be mindful of sensitive subjects.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"