span class="Formatted">Are you tired of having to choose between sexy aliens &amp; hot mafia bosses?<br />Do you enjoy some shady intergalactic politics, family drama, &amp; tasty revenge?<br />Are you looking for more books featuring the following terms: omega, alpha, scent, knot, fated mates, and/or heat?<br /><br />Hi, my name is Amanda and if you answered yes to any of the questions above, ho-boy!! Do I have the book (and series) for YOU!! <br /><br />Enter Broken Heir, book 3 in the Ruthless Warlords series by Alison Aimes. <br /><br />This series follows the Skolov brothers as they work to maintain &amp; grow their family’s power that they’ve fought tirelessly to gain.<br />Little do these brutal alpha males know that they are about to go *omegaverse feral* over some unsuspecting omegas on their climb to the top! <br /><br />Oh &amp; did I mention that they’re all shredded giant red aliens with horns?? <br /><br />At this point you may be thinking, Amanda, what’s happening? <br />Mafia? Alien? Omegaverse? Fated mates? Where am I?<br />And to that I say, don’t worry babes, it works!! I got you!<br /><br />Broken Heir in particular gave everything that it needed to give &amp; then some!!<br />I meeeean we got:<br />Strangers to lovers for “just one night” to oh-shit-what-are-you-doing-here?? to ~I scratch your back you scratch mine~ to “it won’t work” to lovers<br />Forced proximity in order to avoid the sun burning you to death<br />Dare I say, a sexy Dr. Jekyl/Mr. Hyde retelling-ish<br />I might lose control if you touch me dhljsghlsg!!! <br />I’ve never scented anything like this before?! I must find it &amp; claim it NOW<br />Some glorious omegaverse SPiCE!!<br />A dash of twists, turns, surprises, &amp; reveals<br />Delicious justice &amp; vengeance!!! <br />A big hulking hottie alien mafioso w/ so much depth &amp; vulnerability that had me melting!! <br />A badass, selfless, smart heroine w/ an incredible character arc!<br />&amp; these 2 together?! Fireworks babyyyy!! Not only was the chemistry palpable but their adoration, passion, and acceptance of each other had me cheesin’ hard! <br /><br />Alison Aimes, you have won my horny heart yet again!! <br /><br />Thank you to @greyspromo for an ARC in exchange for my honest review. <br /><br /><br />CW: graphic sex, childhood trauma, emotional/physical abuse, degradation, mentions of sexual assault, rape, child abuse/assault, murder, torture, drug and alcohol use </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/34370330?shelf=unique-anatomy" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">unique-anatomy</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 comment</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980