"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=paranormal-fantasy"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4369204239"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hGil83Sg5HMa44rLDc2MnQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hGil83Sg5HMa44rLDc2MnQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:10717098"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1718604910064,"createdAt":1646764669579,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1647177920754,"text":"Broken Heir is book three in the Ruthless Warlords series by Alison Aimes. This series is so dark and twisty. But it is also sweet and full of hope and love. I have been so excited for Alexi’s book and it was everything!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlexi Skolov is the most broken of the Skolov siblings. He spends his time in the pleasure district and always comes home smelling of all sorts of illicit things. But he has volunteered to travel to the Sartin compound because that is where the path leads to finding their missing brother that was stolen from them when he was an infant. By promising to wed one of the Sartin daughters, he will be able to enter their compound to search for clues. Now all he has to do is keep himself under control and not let anyone see what he truly is, a beast. All of these goals go out the window, though, when he first catches her scent. From that moment on, SHE is all he wants.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1646764676i/32662949._SY540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKeira Sartin is the defective daughter of the family. Told repeatedly that she is worthless. Because of this, the alphas in her family freely discuss things in her presence. Unknowingly giving her much needed information she can use for her own agenda. An agenda that does not include the very sexy alpha she meets. The same alpha she later discovers is supposed to marry her younger sister. All she has to do is stay away from him which proves much more difficult than she imagined.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“I’d rather drag you into the darkness with me than take another breath without you.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlexi and Keira together were scorchingly hot. But they also were so much more. They were the missing part of each other they didn’t even know existed. As always with this series, we are kept on the edge of our seat from page one until the very last word. I am continually surprised at the amount of love these Skolov siblings share and never hesitate to show one another in the dark world they exist in. I believe it is this love, this commitment to one another that always pulls them through. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1646764676i/32662950.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis has a perfect epilogue and we are also given just a hint of the next book, Filthy Royal, which will be Damien’s book. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“I’ve waited a lifetime to find you.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor more about this book and so many others, come and visit me at Carol's Crazy Bookish World.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/CarolsCrazyBookishWorld\"\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/groups/Carol...\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1502304251i/23548582.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":66,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":19},"User:145247010":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":145247010,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1685036903i/145247010._UY200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":570,"textReviewsCount":265,"name":"readabookonce","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/145247010-readabookonce","contributor":null,"id":145247010},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=alien"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"monster","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=monster"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=fated-mates"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5721679390"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.E0gvJIN6jJKkxEUOwpTU2A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.E0gvJIN6jJKkxEUOwpTU2A","creator":{"__ref":"User:145247010"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1727976677967,"createdAt":1690492854962,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1690508398098,"text":"The mischievous, “carefree” character who is fighting serious internal demons is my favoriteeeeee kind of love interest.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eMAIN CHARACTER NAMES AND AGES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKeira Sartin (?) \u003cb\u003e|\u003c/b\u003e Alexi Skolov (~24)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eFEATURES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e∘ sci-fi mafia romance\u003cbr /\u003e∘ omegaverse\u003cbr /\u003e∘ fated mates\u003cbr /\u003e∘ hulk-like alter ego\u003cbr /\u003e∘ dangerous to everyone but her / only \u003ci\u003eshe\u003c/i\u003e can calm him\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eREVIEW\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKeira and Alexi are probably my favorite couple of the series. They’ve not had it easy in their respective lives, but with the other’s help, they set each other free (literally in Kiera’s case, figuratively in Alexi’s).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI appreciated that Keira was realistically afraid of Alexi’s berserketh alter ego at first. She stops fearing it when she realizes he’d never hurt her, and for most of the novel, Alexi is more fearful of it than she is. His inner monologue about how much of a monster was did get repetitive (and significantly lengthened the novel), but otherwise, the pacing was great.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe finally get some answers—and new questions—to the overarching plot to the series. I love a conspiracy, and there’s plenty to go around in this universe.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWith each entry I read, I fall a little more in love with the series. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eOW/OM DRAMA\u003c/b\u003e none\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eCHEATING\u003c/b\u003e none\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eTHIRD ACT BREAKUP\u003c/b\u003e no\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eENDING\u003c/b\u003e HEA — epilogue set in near future\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003ePOV\u003c/b\u003e dual / third person\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eSPICE LEVEL\u003c/b\u003e 4 / 5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eRATING\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 / 5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eFor those who DNFed and want answers…\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eSPOILERS\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eTwin Status\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"139b0390-e769-4169-ae12-ef2592e27d94\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"139b0390-e769-4169-ae12-ef2592e27d94\"\u003eAs we know, the Skolov siblings have been searching for their missing twin siblings. They discover that the identity of their younger brother is Maddox, Baro’s “son” and heir. He used someone else’s blood for the DNA test so that he could retain his position as the Sartin heir to overthrow the evil Baro.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTheir sister’s location/identity has no updates.\u003c/label\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eWho is Rose?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"71fe9b21-c4a4-4f4b-87ab-e7bf2fe2d39d\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"71fe9b21-c4a4-4f4b-87ab-e7bf2fe2d39d\"\u003eWhenever Alexi starts to lose control and the berserketh takes over, he sees someone named Rose.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShe was a pleasure omega who propositioned Alexi after his brutal kidnapping and torture. She touches him to get his attention, and he loses control and slashes her brutally. He had to be stunned, but Rose survived. She has since been financially compensated and has moved on. She doesn’t appear in the story, although Alexi harbors severe guilt over this.\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eBaro’s Traitor\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"3d4b81a5-b6cc-4883-ad9d-2af2eaf3125f\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"3d4b81a5-b6cc-4883-ad9d-2af2eaf3125f\"\u003eThe individual who has been setting Baro up and snitching to the Brotherhood is Dugar Sartin, Keira’s father and Baro’s brother. He was resentful that the Sartin heir isn’t his son, Cole, and instead is Baro’s son (who isn’t actually his son). \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHe has been trying for years to overthrow Baro, and almost succeeds, if it weren’t for those meddling kids.\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Identity of the Series Antagonist\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"4d85c7cd-217d-40bd-9cc0-abd06d853013\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"4d85c7cd-217d-40bd-9cc0-abd06d853013\"\u003eThis was a significant entry in the series, as we discover the identity of the culprit who stole the twins and has continuously tried to harm the Skolovs. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHe was born Darvish Sartin (a distant relative of Keira) to an omega of the Sartin line. She was expected to make a good match, but was “seduced by an off-planet Alpha who made no offer to procure her and claim her as his prime omega, even once her breeding state became known.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAt birth, he was pronounced “defective” because he was missing a horn. For this reason, his mother and he were exiled by Baro’s father. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDarvish’s father is none other than Burian Skolov (father of the Skolov siblings), meaning that Darvish is their [the protagonists of this series] half-brother. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cs\u003eI had to reread this information at least three times because I thought Darvish was Dugar (Keira’s father), and I was like no way did they just make this main couple incestuous. Upon reread, that is not the case. Because while Keira and Alexi may both be related to Darvish, they are NOT related to each other.\u003c/s\u003e\u003c/label\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":23,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:70316517":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":70316517,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1570843185i/70316517.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2764,"textReviewsCount":3284,"name":"Ꮗ€♫◗☿ ❤️ ilikebooksbest.com ❤️","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/70316517-ilikebooksbest-com","contributor":null,"id":70316517},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.wCj_Y_tV_HQRiUJT":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.wCj_Y_tV_HQRiUJT"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.wCj_Y_tV_HQRiUJT\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.wCj_Y_tV_HQRiUJT","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.wCj_Y_tV_HQRiUJT"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"00-audiobooks-i-own","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=00-audiobooks-i-own"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"action-adventure","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=action-adventure"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"aliens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=aliens"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"audiobook","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=audiobook"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=dark-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"erotic-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=erotic-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"science-fiction","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=science-fiction"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=romance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6436342983"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kYmNGhTAkXhl9Z4LwoSFcQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kYmNGhTAkXhl9Z4LwoSFcQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:70316517"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1766950587162,"createdAt":1715970516663,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1716426625826,"text":"\u003cb\u003e“Together we fight, together we rise!”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1715979630i/35530249._SY540_.png\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe following ratings are out of 5:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRomance: 💚🖤💙💖\u003cbr\u003eHeat/Steam: 🔥🔥🔥\u003cbr\u003eStory/Plot: 📕📗📘📙📔\u003cbr\u003eWorld building: 🌏🌍🌎🌏🌍\u003cbr\u003eCharacter development: 😄😮🙂🥰😍\u003cbr\u003eNarrator(s): 🎙🎙🎙🎙🎙\u003cbr\u003eNarration type: Duet Narration\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Hero:\u003c/b\u003e \u003cu\u003eAlexi Skolov\u003c/u\u003e - he is another alpha male in the Anarcheim Alphaverse, and is a second brother to Nikolai Skolov, the head alpha boss of the Skolov clan in the Brotherhood syndicate. He was tasked with getting into the Sarten compound to find his brother Mikhail, finding the beta servant who took his twin siblings (Mikhail and Zaya), and to uncover any clues about the enemy who paid the beta servant to abduct the twins when they were babies. Alexi was using an alliance between the Skolov’s and Sarten’s as a ruse to get into their compound. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe heroine:\u003c/b\u003e \u003cu\u003eKeira Sarten\u003c/u\u003e - she lived with her vicious uncle, Barro Sarten who was the alpha of her clan and head of the Sarten crime family. Her uncle had survived six assassination attempts and is no stranger to violence. He loves to hurt people and had a special room which he used to discipline his servants and family. She was once prime Omega to alpha Tan, but now that she was a widow she was no longer buffered from her uncles advances. Her gift never manifested so he often threatened her and marked her with his derision. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Story:\u003c/b\u003e Barro Sarten was a bit worried that the Brotherhood would find out about his illicit side business that he never told the brotherhood about. Especially since they have been taking losses from thieves who had been stealing from the same side business. Though he was happy to find that the Skolov family has agreed to an alliance. Since Keira was a widow with no gifts, he chose her younger sister Callie to punish her. Though she had a plan and Barro played straight into her hands. It was her chance to get Callie away and under the protection of a stronger family before her uncles' misdeeds came back to haunt them. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlexi wasn’t too happy to see his child bride, he liked an omega with more experience who could handle his twisted side. When he smelled a tantalizing, exotic female scent, he felt something right away and found it was Keira. He worried it was the same thing his brothers felt when they found their fated mates. Though Alexi had a past, when he was thirteen, he’d been captured and tortured by a rival gang, he had also been in love with a girl named Rose who had died and he thinks himself broken, he has a beast that comes out at times. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI liked the characters in this book. Kiera was fierce in spite of all the violence she faced from her uncle. Turns out it was Kiera who had been stealing his uncles’ omegas from his trafficking business. She would take pregnant females and remove their trackers before they gave birth, and her uncle could sell their babies. She would get 200 lashes if she was found out. Alexi was also good at heart. He stopped a guy from beating a whore even when his brothers warned him not to get involved. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis audiobook was told in dual points of view via duet narration and was narrated by Jason Clarke and Stella Hunter. These two are both great narrators and you can’t really go wrong with either or both of them. Jason has a deep and sexy voice while Stella has a feminine yet intelligent sounding voice, both are perfect for these characters. I just love that more books lately are being narrated in duet narration!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.ilikebooksbest.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBlog\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/wennel\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eGoodreads\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ilikebooksbest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFacebook\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ilikebooksbest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.twitter.com/wendysu020202\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eTwitter\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.bookbub.com/profile/1895823057\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBookBub\u003c/a\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.wCj_Y_tV_HQRiUJT\"}}"},"likeCount":22,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:31792110":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":31792110,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1773790297i/31792110._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"fo