ystery of who is after the Sokolov family is an intertwining theme in the story as well. I loved Kiera and Alexi and their HEA.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI received this book from the author and I'm giving this completely honest and unbiased review.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A213KX8WYZL1S4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":9,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:98512744":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":98512744,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1764079992i/98512744._CR26,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":228,"textReviewsCount":984,"name":"JD (on semi-hiatus)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/98512744-jd-on-semi-hiatus","contributor":null,"id":98512744},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A37V9I552BX9K8":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A37V9I552BX9K8"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A37V9I552BX9K8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A37V9I552BX9K8","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A37V9I552BX9K8"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"consenusal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=consenusal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"descriptive","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=descriptive"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"good-girl-bad-boy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=good-girl-bad-boy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"interesting","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=interesting"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"likeable-characters","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=likeable-characters"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mutual-respect","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=mutual-respect"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"overstuffed-plot","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=overstuffed-plot"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"repetitious","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=repetitious"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"strong-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=strong-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"too-long","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=too-long"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4615289015"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LdLj-cY7MtBVYrtds_ff6g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LdLj-cY7MtBVYrtds_ff6g","creator":{"__ref":"User:98512744"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1657924872163,"createdAt":1648188474248,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1648305759727,"text":"\u003cb\u003e\u003cs\u003eThe Incredible Hulk\u003c/s\u003e Alexi Meets Keira\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is the third in the author's dystopian Mafia Omegaverse; since each entry features one Skolov sibling, we're now on brother three: the most physically powerful and also the most damaged. Severely affected by cruel scientific experiments that left him with even greater-than-usual Alpha strength and an inability to control murderous rages, Alexi comes to Keira's uncle's compound to search for his missing little brother, but his immediate attraction to his fated mate throws him momentarily off-track. Can his \"Starlight\" tame the monster within him? Note: Although the MC meet for the first time here, so many characters, plot points, and one overarching mystery (the Skolovs' search for their youngest siblings, missing since infancy) continue from previous books that I think it's best to read the books in order. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAs with the other entries, I really liked this, particularly four aspects. First, the worldbuilding is hauntingly visceral (the descriptions of the planet's pleasure district and the Sartin estate evoke the apocalyptic underworld hellishness of \u003ci\u003eMetropolis\u003c/i\u003e, \u003ci\u003eStrange Days\u003c/i\u003e, and \u003ci\u003eBlade Runner\u003c/i\u003e combined). Second, the plot twists were ones I didn't see coming and, thus, genuine surprises. Third, Ms. Aimes introduces disability into what is usually a very abled genre. And, finally, the MC was extremely sympathetic with competing motivations that create organic conflict (while Alexi wants nothing more than to rescue Keira from her abusive uncle, she wants to stay in order to protect the other Omegas). I really liked that the usual Omegaverse insta-love was deepened by a connection that went beyond the sexual: both are \"damaged\" (Keira is considered \"defective\" because she's giftless and barren); therefore, each understands the pain and humiliation the other feels. While this takes the \"good girl/bad boy\" trope to the nth degree, I didn't mind it here because Keira actively participates in the narrative; her intelligence and inner strength apparent throughout (it's interesting that her \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"566fa9e6-8161-4a66-864a-22f95a8b75fa\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"566fa9e6-8161-4a66-864a-22f95a8b75fa\"\u003egift turns out to be one that may or not be magical\u003c/label\u003e). I spent the entire book hoping they'd get their HEA and there's no higher praise for a book in this genre than that.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI do have some quibbles. This didn't need to be as long as it was (editing Alexi's repetitive \"I'm a monster\" dialogue would have cut off a good chunk); there were a few too many double bluffs and climaxes (plot, not sexual) towards the end to be remotely plausible; and I would have liked to have seen Keira interact with \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"e35e4712-d799-4ecd-9155-833db7741717\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"e35e4712-d799-4ecd-9155-833db7741717\"\u003eher sisters-in-law\u003c/label\u003e. But Ms. Aimes has created such a warm, vibrant, close-knit family in the Skolovs that these are minor criticisms.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e4 1/2 stars. Damien is up next. Side Notes: I hope we see the female underground railroad rescue pilot again and \"scent mufflers\" have new meaning in the Age of COVID.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A37V9I552BX9K8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}"},"likeCount":7,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:10821438":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10821438,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1619878776i/10821438._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":72,"textReviewsCount":1418,"name":"Lori R.","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10821438-lori-r","contributor":null,"id":10821438},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10821438?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4369432251"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FpIgBv4EpGAyGy1tr0u9rA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FpIgBv4EpGAyGy1tr0u9rA","creator":{"__ref":"User:10821438"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1648407144961,"createdAt":1647699483483,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1648059376486,"text":"This was SO GOOD!!!! \u003cbr /\u003eAlison always WOWs me in the best ways possible.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI am obsessed with this series. I’m so in love with all of the characters. My most recent loves are Alexi (muthafuckin’ swoon!) and Keira (such a BADASS heroine!) They are PASSIONATE and FIERCE and PROTECTIVE…and deliciously FILTHY. Their connection to each is strong, their chemistry sizzling and white hot. And the love they have for each other? Enviable and so beautiful. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI swear my kindle was overheating during most of this story. And it was vibrating and trembling from the intensity of the story. Or was that me trembling and getting too hot? …probably both. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOnce again, Miss Alison has rocked my world and punched me in the feels, aaalllllll the feels…EVERYWHERE. But if getting punched feels that good, then I’d happily take those punches every. day. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi is on a mission to find his missing brother. He needs to prove to his other siblings that he’s more than the gorgeous alpha who has all the omegas dropping to their knees. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere was never a dull moment in this action-packed story. Not only was it entertaining and full of kindle-gripping goodness, it also had lots and lots of toe-curling yumminess and heartwarming love and adoration and so many moments that put little hearts in my eyes. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi is so much more than what everyone believes him to be. His loyalty and determination and dedication…so admirable. His strength and kindness and the need to please and care for his omega…so effing swoony and charming and sweet and left me all smiley and drunk with contentment and happiness. *sigh*\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eGive me that sexy beast!\u003cbr /\u003eThe growls, the fangs, the eyes…I’ll take all of him, just the way he is please and thank you. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBroken Heir was yet another masterpiece in this amazingly written series. So many captivating moments had me glued to my Kindle. Some parts so emotionally intense, I wanted to hug someone. Scenes so intoxicating, I couldn’t look away if I tried. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI highly recommend this book. If you’ve read and loved the other books in this series, you need this one. If you haven’t read this series, do yourself a favor and start it soon. You won’t regret it. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIf I ever get so lucky to meet Alison Aimes, I will probably embarrass myself fangirling so hard. :)","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":