th to help others and take down people at the top. Alexi has been a mystery until now, always partying and disappearing. I couldn't wait to find out what he was thinking and going through and it's pretty rough. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi has a monster inside of him that he struggles to control with drugs and random women. Then he meets Keira and his world turns on it's head. She tames the beast and gives him hope that he might be able to live a full and happy life. But first he has to get her away from her abusive family and find his missing brother. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI thought this was fun and fast paced, with a great romantic story (and nicely done steamy scenes.) I liked that we learned more about the missing Skolov brother and who is behind the twins' kidnapping. The series has been great and I'm happy the third book is out now!","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ASTNJMTYU3JUT\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}"},"likeCount":6,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:97546350":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":97546350,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1637764251i/97546350._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2333,"textReviewsCount":1330,"name":"Giorgia Reads","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/97546350-giorgia-reads","contributor":null,"id":97546350},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6