9713},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/79319713?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3804345404"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ZUjPov4rt7r5c4tMcO9x_A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ZUjPov4rt7r5c4tMcO9x_A","creator":{"__ref":"User:79319713"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1648786022969,"createdAt":1648568167243,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1648568173024,"text":"4.5 stars! This is the third book in the Ruthless Warlords series and features Keira and Alexi and it was an epic love story between two tragically scarred souls that find each other and thrive.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“I’d rather… drag you into the darkness with me… than take another breath without you.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAfter the events of the second book, Alexi goes to meet his betrothed and ends up finding his fated mate and falls into bed with her without knowing who she is. Keira (who has plans of her own) also has no idea who Alexi is but they find out shortly after and it sets a string of events in place that sets a new path for Alexi and his family, Keira, and the quest to discover where Alexi's siblings are. Will they all make it out in one piece?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi was the broken Alpha with a tragic past and he has carried that past with him for a long time always worried that he will snap one day and have to be put down. His inner turmoil was sad to read but Keira's light brought him back from the brink of loneliness and hopelessness and gave him a new lease on life. Alexi thinks so badly of himself and the beast he can become at times but deep down he is a loyal and devoted Alpha with so much heart, love and devotion to give. He only had to finally see it.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“Mine… to touch. Mine… to pleasure. They want me… to hurt you? Fuck that. I’ve had enough… pain and violence to last… a lifetime. You belong to me now, and… I care for what’s mine.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKeira also has a heartbreaking past but she has a spine of steel and fights for those she considers \"hers.\" She was the perfect other half to Alexi and I loved that she accepted every little piece of him and the feelings and reactions she had to him. Their mutual respect and adoration for each other created a beautiful relationship between the two that I couldn't help but love. Her tenacity and strength made her and Alexi an unbreakable force.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“We fit because we are alike, Alexi. Because deep down, I’m as ferocious as you, and I will do anything—risk anything—to keep you with me\"\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBroken Heir was a steamy steamy Omegaverse. I loved Alexi's animalistic tendencies and his domineering, controlling and possessive attitude toward Keira. Their intimate moments were *chefs kiss.* I enjoyed that this was also action packed and kept you on your toes with revelations I never saw coming. It sets the stage for more stories and I can't wait to read what's next in this world and their continuing quest to locate their sister. I only wish that we had gotten more time with Alexi and Keira being bonded. If you like darker Omegaverse stories with strong Alphas and their feisty Omegas, then I definitely suggest picking up this series!\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":6,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:50314367":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":50314367,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":102,"textReviewsCount":1091,"name":"BeeKay","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/50314367-beekay","contributor":null,"id":50314367},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2022-books","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=2022-books"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"five-star-read","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=five-star-read"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"anti-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=anti-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=arc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"monsters","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=monsters"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=omegaverse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=sci-fi"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"shifters","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=shifters"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4133258894"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kom5UjgGbUDnbGjJSJqdNQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kom5UjgGbUDnbGjJSJqdNQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:50314367"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1650416526196,"createdAt":1647036906101,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1650416525592,"text":"\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1650416517i/32833617._SY540_.png\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA tragic journey to find love, hope, and acceptance for two damaged souls...\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e*****\u003cbr\u003eRating: 5 stars\u003cbr\u003eSteam: 3 flames\u003cbr\u003eGenre: Omegaverse / Mafia / Sci-fi Romance/ Fated Mates / Broken Hero \u0026amp; Heroine\u003cbr\u003e*****\u003cbr\u003eNote to self… do not start a new Alison Aimes book at 8 pm on a work night thinking, “I will only read a few chapters…” Yeah, that did not happen…Once I started reading this book, I became so engrossed by the plot, twists, and turns that I stayed up all night reading! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis book was AH-MAZING! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlexi was so much more than I imagined. His backstory was tragic and what he suffered at 13 yrs old… horrendous. However, getting inside his head was almost worse, the self-loathing/deprecation and fear could almost be felt through the pages. Despite the horrors he endured, he remained a good man... In beast mode, he may unalive a lot of people, but he remained a protector…deeply devoted to his family, and then Keira. He's also sexy and determined to keep his omega satisfied if you know what I mean (wink wink). PLEASE! YES!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKeira's past is equally heartbreaking, and the fact that she puts that aside...puts all the cruelty she lives with aside, to safeguard those who are unable to protect themselves... I adored her character. Not only is she strong…she is the perfect match for Alexi and his beast.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBroken Heir was an exciting, steamy, action-packed story full of betrayal, deception, and jaw-dropping twists and turns. The end had me losing my mind! And the character growth, even with the Alpha / Omega dynamic, Alexi and Keira matured romantically throughout the story, and in the end, their relationship was more than just pheromones; it was a true bonding! SWOON!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you are looking for a magnificent sci-fi omegaverse mafia, with plenty of steam, unaliving, and a gripping storyline… THIS IS YOUR BOOK! Actually, THIS IS YOUR SERIES! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMy only regret… I read Broken Heir too quickly and now that it is over… I want… no need…more! This book/series gets all my recommendations and is a MUST READ romance in my opinion!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving