arranged-marriage","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/64990515?shelf=arranged-marriage"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"awesome-storyline","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/64990515?shelf=awesome-storyline"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"awesome-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/64990515?shelf=awesome-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"awesome-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/64990515?shelf=awesome-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/64990515?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"erotic-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/64990515?shelf=erotic-romance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4767189819"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hzi6PmFCyZX0HLlPDFTXUg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hzi6PmFCyZX0HLlPDFTXUg","creator":{"__ref":"User:64990515"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1728232994026,"createdAt":1654521182529,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1654530248043,"text":"\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003eOVERALL 5 STARS\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWriting:\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 Stars\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eStory line:\u003c/b\u003e 5 Stars\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSteam:\u003c/b\u003e 4 Stars\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eHero:\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 Stars\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eHeroine:\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 Stars\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003eQUICK REVIEW\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is the third book in the series and I honestly didn't think I'll feel so angsty for another Skolov brother after reading Nikolai's book (Book 1). I had thought Nikolai had it toughest as he's the oldest brother and had suffered for his family most but Alexi had an equally tragic experience and it really broke my heart to know that he hadn't really gotten through the trauma unlike Nikolai, so it was actually more heartbreaking for me to read this book. I am just glad the ending is a good one. The interweaving suspense is really well plotted out and I am looking forward to the next book to uncover the mystery revolving the Skolov siblings! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003eSAFETY\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eH (Hero):\u003c/b\u003e Alexi Skolov \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"df1f0221-3c63-41a8-8f43-7769fc22aebc\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"df1f0221-3c63-41a8-8f43-7769fc22aebc\"\u003e[H masked his pain with booze and drugs and a carefree player persona but deep down, he was just unable to rid himself of his past trauma.]\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eh (heroine):\u003c/b\u003e Keira Sartin \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"4c1a404d-0bb6-40d6-b285-9016b5ba0ffc\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"4c1a404d-0bb6-40d6-b285-9016b5ba0ffc\"\u003e[Married to another alpha and widowed, h is an unassuming brave Omega who protects and saves those in need. ]\u003c/label\u003e \u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eSteam level:\u003c/b\u003e High\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eDescriptive sex:\u003c/b\u003e Yes\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eSafe sex:\u003c/b\u003e No \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"b934902d-2422-4f6d-8f3d-10e124ff1e33\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"b934902d-2422-4f6d-8f3d-10e124ff1e33\"\u003e[h is assumed to be barren from her previous marriage so they did not particularly practice safe sex.]\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eOM (Other Men)/OW (Other Women) drama:\u003c/b\u003e No\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eSexual acts with OM/OW:\u003c/b\u003e No\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eSex scenes with OM/OW:\u003c/b\u003e No\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eVirgin:\u003c/b\u003e No\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eInsta-love/attraction:\u003c/b\u003e Yes\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003ePush/Pull:\u003c/b\u003e Yes \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"cb8a9b64-b096-4553-9085-b712fd063d9a\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"cb8a9b64-b096-4553-9085-b712fd063d9a\"\u003e[H tried to push h away as he felt he was not good enough for h while h tried to suspress her attraction to H since he was supposed to marry her sister.]\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eSeparation:\u003c/b\u003e No\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eAngst:\u003c/b\u003e Low \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"943ddd05-634f-49ab-81d2-c0e0363cf4b5\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"943ddd05-634f-49ab-81d2-c0e0363cf4b5\"\u003e[There is a little bit of angst when it comes to H and his past trauma, and also how he kept thinking to sacrifice himself for those he loves.]\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003ePo