/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/110313728?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2022","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/110313728?shelf=2022"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arcs","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/110313728?shelf=arcs"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"audiobooks","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/110313728?shelf=audiobooks"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"aliens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/110313728?shelf=aliens"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4870536965"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.u4dZbEtnmTeVieXSrYiRdw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.u4dZbEtnmTeVieXSrYiRdw","creator":{"__ref":"User:110313728"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1658946029352,"createdAt":1658887074404,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1658887077366,"text":"\u003ci\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e*ALC received from Audibly Addicted in exchange for my honest review. *\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHoly lord this book! Alison Aimes where were you all those times I said \"Meh, Aliens aren't really my thing.\" let me tell you, they are now!! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen I say this book has everything.... \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- A deliciously HOT alien mafia boss\u003cbr /\u003e- A heroine who doesn't know exactly how much power she wields\u003cbr /\u003e- Fated mates \u003cbr /\u003e- Knotting \u003cbr /\u003e- Murder, betrayal, secrets \u0026amp; the PLOT TWISTS \u003cbr /\u003e- and of course, the steam was *chefs kiss*\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi Skolov really was the beautiful broken beast hero we all crave. From the moment he met Keira he was so concerned with keeping her safe. That was even before the feelings started getting involved. His beast even recognized something in her that he couldn't resist. There were so many times my heart ached for him and the events of his past. By no means was he weak though, he was every bit the beast you would expect from an alien planet. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKeira Sartin was always told she was nothing, less than nothing. She was never good enough for a good life, but Alexi changed her story. What was supposed to be one night ends up becoming the turning point for her. Seeing Keira go from this battered woman who had to mind her tongue to the strong woman by the side of Alexi was the cherry on top of a perfect story. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNarration people. Stella Hunter and Jason Clarke. If I have said it once I will say it again but these two are a match made in narration heaven. The way they play off one another can really be heard and at this point if they are narrating together, I will be listening. I thought I had heard Jason Clarke in all his narration glory, but this role was made for him. With all the growls Alexi tended to make because of his beast. Good heavens, I was in a state in the best way. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhile I should have started with book one of the series (don't worry I will be going back to the beginning), I didn't feel like I was lost at all. Alison did an exceptional job of making this a complete standalone while also bringing in what I would expect are aspects from the previous books. Bravo to you babe because that is hard in Sci-Fi.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A38RWJ4POAT90Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:96798870":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":96798870,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1622770522i/96798870._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":16,"name":"Christen","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/96798870-christen","contributor":null,"id":96798870},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/96798870?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4601520080"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.7e5tLUpDZjvxRf-ogKkAkw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.7e5tLUpDZjvxRf-ogKkAkw","creator":{"__ref":"User:96798870"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1647811581637,"createdAt":1647012150582,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1647012199974,"text":"Mmmm Alexi, you growly hunk of deliciousness...\u003cbr /\u003eIf I were to choose a book boyfriend from Alison Aimes' Dark Mafia Omegaverse, it would be Alexi Skolov... and maybe Damien... but definitely Alexi. Well, I have to wait a while for Damien's book, but Alexi's story was so satisfying. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlison Aimes has crafted another heart pounding adventure with all the feels. Broken Heir pivots us to another corner of Anarcheim - the Alphaverse galaxy. This time to the seedy Sartin crime family where our female main character, Keira Sartin, has lived her life practically squashed under sticky Sartin alpha boots. My heart goes out to Keira and all she has endured but the abuse forged a soul of steel and a unique omega power. I loved this aspect of the story... her power isn't showy, but strong all the same. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi also endured soul-breaking abuse at the hands of abductors when he was young. While these scenes may trigger someone with a history of abuse, the author does a good job at keeping the story moving through the back-flashes and (thankfully) does not get graphic with those scenes. They are not gratuitous and the history is necessary as Alexi's present \"condition\" is a result of his captivity, which plays a very big role in the story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI love Keira and Alexi. Obviously, there is danger and conflict around every corner and a sense of precariousness in their time together. Like all Alison Aimes stories, it moves at a fast pace, but Keira and Alexi manage to carve out some steamy love times. I love a dirty talker and Alexi is just that. In fact, the book starts right off with a teaser scene to get you salivating. Luckily, you don't have to wait long for the main course. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBroken Heir also brings home one long-lost Skolov sibling. I don't want to spoil the story, but it was totally satisfying. I cannot wait to find out where the other twin has been hiding. Something tells me they are as kick-@$$ as their siblings.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDamien's story is up next and, based on the bonus epilogue provided, it is going to be yummy!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBy the way, I received an advanced reader copy in exchange for my honest review.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH\"},\"book\":{\"id\"