 to escape.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOne night together left them with mind blowing passion and steamy moment,but little did they know that Alexi is the future husband to Kiara sister. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlison Aimes write the hottest,caring and possessive Alpha males. I over Alexy he maybe is feral and scary man ,but he love so fiercely he's family and mate.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKiara was also so strong woman,who has gone through so many trials, but she is still doesn't give up.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAfter reading this book I can't really wait to read the next book Filthy Royal","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A267D7C3JMM9Y2\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:2612699":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":2612699,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1511930513i/2612699.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":10,"textReviewsCount":242,"name":"Tricia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/2612699-tricia","contributor":null,"id":2612699},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2B8MFLENNSL28":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B8MFLENNSL28"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B8MFLENNSL28\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2B8MFLENNSL28","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B8MFLENNSL28"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"abuse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abuse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"abused-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abused-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"abused-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abused-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alien-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien-heroes","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alien-heroes"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alien-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alpha","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alpha"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alpha-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alpha-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"bad-mother","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=bad-mother"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"bad-parents","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=bad-parents"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4374541674"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Q8qXs91foZkx58NahVLqyw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Q8qXs91foZkx58NahVLqyw","creator":{"__ref":"User:2612699"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1650555826182,"createdAt":1647810403559,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1650555825645,"text":"Broken Heir is book three in the raw and darkly sexy world of author Alison Aimes Ruthless Warlords. This story takes place on the brutal world ruled by the Sartin's. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKeria Sartin is the abused and brave daughter of the Alpha’s brother. Because they think that she is nothing and no one they speak freely around her so she has knowledge of everything that goes on in the household. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eShe has her own, personal plans and she uses the information that she is privy to to save others from the hateful Alpha. She learns that her sister is to be married to a powerful Alpha. But before she can do anything about that she has other plans in motion that must be fulfilled. Escaping her uncle’s warrior’s, she is saved by a very handsome and strong Alpha. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlexi Skolov is a tortured male. Almost broken in spirit and mind but he holds tight the beast that wants to break free. He uses women and drugs and liquor to dull his wild urges. He’s on a mission to the Sartin’s seeking family information. And he is to sign a marriage contract with a Sartin bride. He doesn’t care. He only wants to complete his mission. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThey were never supposed to meet but it was fate. When Alexi and Keria come together each knows that it’s more than a forbidden night. They are soul mates. They complete each other. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis universe is mean and dark and savage. Danger lurks around every turn. But the love that shines from the family Skolov breaks through as if a million shining suns. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you love dark, sexy, strong Alpha’s and smart, brave, beautiful heroines this series is worth reading! It takes you into their world and love and it’s brilliant! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1642780055i/32473872.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"115\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B8MFLENNSL28\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:77019909":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":77019909,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1602985103i/77019909._UX200_CR0,26,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":13,"textReviewsCount":1031,"name":"Jean Stillman","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/77019909-jean-stillman","contributor":null,"id":77019909},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/77019909?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4369139076"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.u0_Nzue9olLGPKf1gs7yZg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.u0_Nzue9olLGPKf1gs7yZg","creator":{"__ref":"User:77019909"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1647811530452,"createdAt":1646746768791,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1646787548023,"text":"For anyone who hasn't yet read the\"Ruthless Warlords\" series by author, Alison Aimes, my question is, \"What are you waiting for?\" This series is an omegaverse romance about the Skolov crime family, whose members have grown from poverty to one of the richest and most powerful families in the brotherhood.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Broken Heir\" is the newest addition to this fabulous saga! And this is Alexi's story. Alexi is the broken brother. Kidnapped as a child, he was tortured, abused, beaten, and injected with drugs to create a berserker beast within him. Although he was eventually found and rescued by his brothers, the damage had been done. He is the bad boy of the Skolov family: massive, good looking, out of control, and completely alpha! He is dangerous and feels there is no hope for his future. And, what woman doesn't love the bad boy, especially when he will do anything to protect those he loves? Alexi is just yummy!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKeira Sartin is the broken Omega heroine in the story. She is beautiful, smart and underestimated, seen as a barren omega without any special gifts normally indicated in omegas. But while being seen as useless, she is able to achieve her own agenda. She works underground to help omegas escape with their newborn babies to safety, off planet. Keira is a bit of a badass, which I love in a heroine. Her main objective is to see her younger sister married to a member of the Skolov crime family where she will be taken away to safety. But a one night stand with a gorgeous alpha male in the pleasure district will change all of Kiera's plans.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe main plot in this series has been for the Skolov family to find and recover their twin siblings who were stolen from their crib while infants. Now, when the twins are about fifteen, the family has tracked down the whereabouts of the male twin. An underlying plot has been to determine who is attempting to take down the entire brotherhood, but particularly the Skolov family. In this book, we get some resolution, but there is still a ways to go...thus the saga continues! Each book in the series is a standalone novel, featuring one of the Skolov family members and their mate, and is complete with a happy ending. Although there are no cliffhangers, I do recommend that you read the books in order, as the story does evolve.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLove, love, love this series, and \"Broken Heir\" is the absolute best one yet! Alison Aimes does a fantastic job of delivering us an action packed storyline that will keep us on the edge of our seat and she gives us wonderfully written sexy bedroom scenes that are sure to melt panties everywhere! Damien's story is up next and I can't wait!!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:110095965":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":110095965,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1617270755i/110095965._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":14,"textReviewsCount":134,"name":"Alexandria  Redmourn","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/110095965-alexandria-redmourn","contributor":null,"id":110095965},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9O5VB2DXM4C":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9O5VB2DXM4C"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9O5VB2DXM4C\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9O5VB2DXM4C","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9O5VB2DXM4C"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/110095965?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4363556698"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.IHL07VAzEYQqDRa-EHUMLA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.IHL07VAzEYQqDRa-EHUMLA","creator":{"__ref":"User:110095965"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1647811539777,"createdAt":1647031879585,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1647091369755,"text":"i absolutely loved this book!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eafter reading 𝗿𝘂𝘁𝗵𝗹𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗸𝗶𝗻𝗴 and 𝘀𝗮𝘃𝗮𝗴𝗲 𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗰𝗲, of course my expectations for 𝗯𝗿𝗼𝗸𝗲𝗻 𝗵𝗲𝗶𝗿 had to be high and alison met every single one of them. from the easily lovable characters to the plot, i thoroughly enjoyed everything!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ealexi skolov just kept breaking and repairing my heart. his backstory broke my heart more times than i could count, especially the flashback scenes. it felt like my heart was being ripped open as i read about his abusive past and then reading about how much he hated, doubted and undermined himself in the present. he's a person who deserves the entire universe and thankfully, keira is there to give it to him. he's so thoughtful and selfless and considerate, an absolute sweetheart with the perfect amount of possessiveness and dirty talk.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ekeira, my brave baby. she's so fierce and strong and brave. her actions toward the omegas filled me with so much pride, even though i don't know her. even when dealing with alexi's beast, she was so incredibly determined and she's such a powerful individual. i loved seeing her develop her self-confidence and become more reassured and happy with herself. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ekeira and alexi are soulmates, one soul that was split into two halves. their relationship was so pure, so beautiful. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ethe intensity between the two of them in the beginning of the book had me blushing. there's just something so intense, so extreme, so passionate about all the skolovs and it was no different with alexi and his unabashed love and 