e":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/103987494?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4871682146"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.JJLu9-b50kQdYwIjQlc80w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.JJLu9-b50kQdYwIjQlc80w","creator":{"__ref":"User:103987494"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1713627930564,"createdAt":1659816584769,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1659816600747,"text":"(audiobook) I knew what I was getting into: SF, aliens, omegaverse, fated mates, mafia, violence, steam… What I wasn’t expecting was how interesting the characters would be. Way more than the standard alpha and omega.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi is a monster. Due to a terrible past–and I mean terrible, even though it isn’t too explicit, it implies many triggers–he has the hardest time controlling his emotions. It’s not that he’s cold blooded, it’s that he feels too much! Then he becomes a dangerous beast. He’s developped several addiction to numb his feelings. Alexi definitely isn’t your typical hero.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHis destined omega–though he doesn’t realize it at first–is the one nobody wants. Unable to conceive, without any omega power, and with kind of an attitude, Keira is her uncle’s favorite victim. But she’s smart and knows what she wants. A real rebel. Until she spends the night with Alexi. Not that she gives up her objectives, but it just complicates things.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTheir relationship is fascinating. They’re both broken–Alexi from his troubled past, Keira from the constant bullying she’s a victim to, and they have flaws. But they balance each other out. Alexi shows Keira she’s worthy of love and respect, while she tames Alexi’s beast. I loved that.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere’s a lot going on in this book, and there’s never a dull moment for sure. Between the scorching hot intimate scenes between Keira and Alexi and the multiple instances of violence. Triggers involved, be prepared. Also, there are many plot twists.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSince the first book, there’s an ongoing mystery, with the disappearance of the youngest Skolov children years ago. It is at the center of the story and finds some kind of resolution by the end. The whole plot is about Alexi infiltrating the Sartins to find clues about his siblings, and the excuse is an alliance between the Skolovs and the Sartins through the union between Alexi and a Sartin omega. Namely Keira’s sister. And the monster inside Alexi keeps messing up with his plans.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere’s another aspect that I enjoyed a lot, incarnated by Keira’s uncle. He knows the rules, he practices diplomacy, but he’s also selfish and ambitious, and his wants don’t always align with what his position requires. The moments his objectives clash with what the Brotherhood wants from him, and he loses control–and the plot–are greatly entertaining, and always result in more conflicts and action, sometimes violence.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe narration was amazing. The male narrator brings life to a conflicted Alexi, and he’s able to express both the monster and the broken man, and the creature in between–the man trying to contain the beast. The female narrator does great with Keira’s multiple nuances. The brave rebel, the obedient omega, the passionate woman, they’re all here to hear.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eQuickie\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Series: Ruthless warlords #3 (can be read as a standalone)\u003cbr /\u003e- Hashtags: #SF romance #mafia romance #omegaverse #aliens #fated mates\u003cbr /\u003e- Triggers: lots of violence, abuse and death, past extreme child abuse, addictions\u003cbr /\u003e- Main couple: Keira Sartin \u0026amp; Alexi Skolov\u003cbr /\u003e- Hotness: 5/5\u003cbr /\u003e- Romance: 5/5\u003cbr /\u003e- + finally some resolution for the recurring elements of the series!\u003cbr /\u003e- – Alexi’s past was both written too explicitly and not explained enough","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:6523791":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":6523791,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1754056659i/6523791._UX200_CR0,36,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":10,"textReviewsCount":1813,"name":"Jerrica (Mrsmar10Reads) Martin ","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/6523791-jerrica-mrsmar10reads-martin","contributor":null,"id":6523791},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A14E5QRNAZ5CAN":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A14E5QRNAZ5CAN"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A14E5QRNAZ5CAN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A14E5QRNAZ5CAN","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A14E5QRNAZ5CAN"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":tru