003cbr /\u003eA big hulking hottie alien mafioso w/ so much depth \u0026amp; vulnerability that had me melting!! \u003cbr /\u003eA badass, selfless, smart heroine w/ an incredible character arc!\u003cbr /\u003e\u0026amp; these 2 together?! Fireworks babyyyy!! Not only was the chemistry palpable but their adoration, passion, and acceptance of each other had me cheesin’ hard! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlison Aimes, you have won my horny heart yet again!! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you to @greyspromo for an ARC in exchange for my honest review. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCW: graphic sex, childhood trauma, emotional/physical abuse, degradation, mentions of sexual assault, rape, child abuse/assault, murder, torture, drug and alcohol use ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A15D0EZ2I00XWE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:10209236":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10209236,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1581282028i/10209236._UX200_CR0,24,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":77,"textReviewsCount":2288,"name":"Kay Daniels (Kay Daniels Romance)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10209236-kay-daniels-kay-daniels-romance","contributor":null,"id":10209236},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fantasy-sci-fi-pnr-supernatural","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=fantasy-sci-fi-pnr-supernatural"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=fated-mates"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4529056298"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.6x4hrm1tl7vqke7c9hk17Q":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.6x4hrm1tl7vqke7c9hk17Q","creator":{"__ref":"User:10209236"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1647811541056,"createdAt":1647531070214,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1647531162359,"text":"Delicious Alphaverse action from start to finish! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi Skolov is on a mission. He's been tasked to find his missing brother and he's currently in the desolate region of Sartin. A burnt out terrain where the sun will scorch you if you are caught out in the sun's rays. This world isn't for the meek and it breaks Alexis' heart knowing his lost brother could have ended up here when he was kidnapped almost sixteen years ago. To even enter this dark world, terms had to be met, Alexi has been promised to one of the omega's. So while he was originally hoping to only leave with his brother, he'll also be leaving with a mate. That was a term he never saw for himself, especially considering his condition.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKeira Sartin has been put down and told she's worthless most of her life. While she realizes that omegas serve their purpose, she realizes that her lack of gift and ability to produce an heir makes her less than other omegas. However, she's never let it get in the way of helping others. She uses her intellect and kindness to help the underground movement and helps omegas escape the abuse and omega trading right from under her uncle's nose. While he believes she's worthless and unnoticeable, she uses that fact against him at every turn.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi and Keira may have never met under normal circumstances, but fate has a way of working out. These two souls have felt broken and worthless their entire lives, that is until they meet and realize that together they are worthy. Together they can achieve anything. Together they can see each other's potential, which truly strengthens their inner qualities. Qualities that they used to believe were weaknesses. Their story is full of passion, but more than that it's one of building self esteem, inner beauty from believing in yourself, and loving yourself so you can love someone else. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere were moments where their brokenness is emotional, but the strength they draw from one another is so beautiful I couldn't help but feel their love pour off the page and don't get me startled on their passion. Whew! Hot! Hot! Hot!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlso, Keira's cousin, Maddox, is an amazing secondary character, but that's all I'm saying about him for now. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI love this entire omegaverse world, but Alexi and Keira may be my favorite couple yet.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:84623690":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":84623690,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":3435,"name":"Sue","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/84623690-sue","contributor":null,"id":84623690},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84623690?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4614563817"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.zKXSiN37ZiXt7xzbtDnuzA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.zKXSiN37ZiXt7xzbtDnuzA","creator":{"__ref":"User:84623690"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1648080265291,"createdAt":1647561511106,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1648080265093,"text":"Wonderful third book in the series, great characters and plot was simply riveting reading\u003cbr /\u003eKeira Sartin an Omega that had been treated so poorly by the family she had ended up with after her Alpha had died after only a few years and the now in the Sartin household she had seen such horrors under her sire and his brother who was a cruel and murderous life she had barely escaped with her life.\u003cbr /\u003eThat night she had sneaked out of the compound to help one of the Omegas that Barro had impregnated gave birth to a daughter and once again her uncle had decided to sell the child and the mother. She had been sneaking away rescuing the babies and the mothers and putting them onto spaceships that took them to a place of safety.\u003cbr /\u003eThen one night she had been on one such excursion and then had been injured when she had scented a male that her Omega knew was of importance to you, the Alpha had been so handsome and Alexi had been entranced by her and his beast had known that she his starlight was his and he would never let her go.\u003cbr /\u003eAs he took her as her Prime Omega and he explained that he was looking for his brother stolen from his family all those years ago and now she was going to help him and together they were going to get away together. \u003cbr /\u003eThis is a wonderful read and I have loved every single moment of this book and I am sure that like myself you will find yourself totally enraptured by this story, I look forward to this amazing book and I am sure that others will be equally as entranced by this book as me.\u003cbr /\u003eI do not want to spoil the plot so will say no more about the three of them, I assure you that you will enjoy every single moment of this book.\u003cbr /\u003eI assure you that you will love every moment of this book it is simply a fantastic read.\u003cbr /\u003eI voluntarily received and review an Advanced Reader Copy\u003cbr /\u003eI thoroughly enjoyed the book and look forward to reading any future publications; keep up all the great writing.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.FcEMjo2yYAf6K7yz\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:36162361":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":36162361,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":38,"textReviewsCount":1898,"name":"Joy Westerfield","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/36162361-joy-westerfield","contributor":null,"id":36162361},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/36162361?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4564743551"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.9rbTDKMHGf_QHUptmy6L7g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.9rbTDKMHGf_QHUptmy6L7g","creator":{"__ref":"User:36162361"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1647811595268,"createdAt":1647529305233,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1647529364614,"text":"I’m a lover of this series and have been anxiously awaiting Alexi’s story. Let me just say, it was well worth the wait! A define 10 plus stars from me! I was hooked from the very first word and couldn’t put it down! It’s hard to put in words exactly how I feel about this phenomenal story without giving it all away, except that you need it in your life!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlexi’s character is one of which you will fall in love with immediately. While he is troubled and has had horrible things happen to him in his past, you can’t help but want to jump into the pages of the book and hug him. He may be all growly and a total Alpha, but when it comes to Keira, all bets are off. They unexpectedly meet one night not knowing who the other is. So imagine what happens when they are formally introduced! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKeira is an Omega, who has had a rough upbringing, but she perseveres and continues to be strong even though others feel she is worthless. When she meets Alexi, she just knows there is something special about him, but she can’t act on her feelings. She has one goal, and he is not part of it. Or is he? Their chemistry is unlike any other and your fingers will burn as you turn the pages because it is so sizzling!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis author has a way of making me feel their emotions deep within my soul, and my heart hurt and broke so many times, but was definitely healed again. I love everything about this story and can’t wait for the next book in this brilliant series!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4cb2Dzuhr-seXbwy\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0}},"params":{"book_id":"55919431-broken-heir"},"query":{"book_id":"55919431-broken-heir"},"jwtToken":null,"dataSource":"Production","authContextParams":{"signedIn":false,"customerId":null,"legacyCustomerId":null,"role":"user"},"userAgentContextParams":{"isWebView":null},"userAgent":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/121.0.0.0 Safari/537.36","initialWeblabTreatments":{"GOODREADS_SIRIUS_AGE_VERIFICATION_1343788":"Unknown"}},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/book/show/[book_id]","query":{"book_id":"55919431-broken-heir"},"buildId":"6i65RVCszqHwMAgi0OeZw","isFallback":false,"isExperimentalCompile":false,"gssp":true,"locale":"en","locales":["en","ab","aa","af","ak","sq","am","ar","an","hy","as","av","ae","ay","az","bm","ba","eu","be","bn","bh","bi","bs","br","bg","my","ca","ch","ce","ceb","ny","zh","zh-TW","cv","kw","co","cr","hr","cs","da","dv","nl","eo","et","ee","fo","fj","fi","fr","ff","gl","ka","de","el","gn","gu","ht","ha","he","hz","hi","ho","hu","ia","id","ie","ilo","ga","ig","ik","io","is","it","iu","ja","jv","kl","kn","kr","ks","kk","km","ki","rw","ky","kv","kg","ko","ku","kj","la","lb","lg","li","ln","lo","lt","lu","lv","gv","mk","mg","ms","ml","mt","mi","mr","mh","mn","na","nv","nb","nd","ne","new","ng","nn","no